oid re-render issues\n\nPlease update the IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md file appropriately, marking these items as complete and adding any notes about the implementation. Focus on sections 2.4, 2.5, and the integration work.","subagent_type":"general"},"output":"task_id: ses_39d6d11a5ffeK2R3F7LZZ795Dw (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nIMPLEMENTation_PLAN.md updated with the completed work:\n\n**Changes Made:**\n1. Added \"Integration Notes\" to section 2.4 (Movement Detection) documenting:\n   - Integration into Game.tsx simulation loop\n   - Automatic RUNNING phase execution at 200ms intervals\n   - Cluster tracking via ref to avoid re-render issues\n   - Classification passed to scoring system\n\n2. Added \"Integration Notes\" to section 2.5 (Scoring System) documenting:\n   - Integration into Game.tsx via handleSimulationStep callback\n   - ScoreDisplay component at top-left with real-time score\n   - Score state management with previousScore for animations\n   - Score resets on Clear/Random/phase transitions\n   - Real-time scoring: MOVER (10pts), OSCILLATOR (2pts), STATIC (0pts)\n\n3. Added new turn summary \"Sprint 2.5 & 2.4 Integration - Game Component Scoring Integration\" in Recent Progress documenting:\n   - handleSimulationStep callback implementation\n   - Automatic simulation stepping during RUNNING phase\n   - ScoreDisplay component integration\n   - Score state and trackedClusters ref management\n   - All tests passing (240), type checking and lint passing for modified files\n\n4. Updated test counts in older entries to reflect current state (240 total)\n</task_result>","title":"Update IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d6d11a5ffeK2R3F7LZZ795Dw","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771180322393,"end":1771180486719}}}}
